  "answer_text": "## Spiegel Home Catalog \u2013 What You Need to Know\n\n### \ud83d\udccc Current Status (2026)\n\nUnfortunately, **Spiegel is no longer actively operating**. As of early 2026, **spiegel.com does not resolve to a working storefront**, and there is no Spiegel print catalog being mailed in the United States.\n\nSpiegel ran from 1865 to roughly 2019, when the brand quietly went dark under Patriarch Partners. According to archived references, the company abruptly ceased operations during the winter of 2019\u20132020. The website came down with no farewell letter, no closeout sale, and no press release of any consequence.\n\nThere is no credible 2024 or 2025 news of a brand revival, a buyer, or a relaunch.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f About Spiegel's History\n\nSpiegel was an American direct marketing retailer founded in 1865 by Joseph Spiegel. The company published a catalog advertising various brands of apparel, accessories, footwear, housewares, toys, tools, firearms, and electronics.\n\nSpiegel delivered its first mail order catalog in 1905, and by 1925 the retailer had 10 million customers. Spiegel's buyers, who attended Paris fashion shows, introduced American women to European fashion trends.\n\nAfter encountering financial difficulty in the early 2000s, the company was purchased by Patriarch Partners and focused on women's style and fashion products. The catalog was eventually discontinued in favor of digital marketing.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udecd\ufe0f Where to Find Spiegel Items Today\n\nSince the brand is no longer active, here are your best options:\n\n1. **eBay** \u2013 Vintage Spiegel clothing turns up regularly on resale sites, and there is a small collector market for the older catalogs themselves on eBay.\n\n2. **Etsy** \u2013 Vintage Spiegel catalogs such as the *1970 Fall/Winter Fashion Vintage Catalog* are available on Etsy for home d\u00e9cor or nostalgia.\n\n3. **Similar Retailers Still Operating** \u2013 Talbots, Soft Surroundings, Appleseed's, and Roaman's are all still operating and still mailing print books in 2026 \u2014 great alternatives for a similar women's fashion catalog experience.\n\n---\n\n> **\ud83d\udca1 Tip:** If you're looking for home d\u00e9cor or women's fashion in the style that Spiegel was known for, checking out **Talbots.com**, **SoftSurroundings.com**, or **Roamans.com** would be great starting points!",
